     /**
+     * Implements the `modify_tools` tool — the AI's session-scoped tool
+     * restriction (mirrors deepseek-harness `ctx.tools.restrict`).
+     *
+     * `deny` hides tools for the rest of the session; `allow` restores them;
+     * `reset` clears the deny list. `modify_tools` itself can never be
